  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven : 10 - 2 ÷ 4 + 6 × 3 = 19\n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the signs:\n\nOption 1) - and ÷\n\n10 - 2 ÷ 4 + 6 × 3 = 19 ⇒ 10 ÷ 2 - 4 + 6 × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ __**10 ÷**____** 2**__ - 4 + 6 × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 5 - 4 + __**6 × 3**__ = 19\n\n⇒ __**5 + 18**__ - 4 = 19\n\n⇒ __23____** - 4**__ = 19\n\n**⇒ 19 = 19 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 2) = and ×\n\n10 - 2 ÷ 4 + 6 × 3 = 19 ⇒ 10 - 2 ÷ 4 + 6 = 3 × 19\n\n⇒ 10 - __**2 ÷ 4**__ + 6 = __**3 **____**× 19**__\n\n⇒ __**10 + 6**__ - 0.5 = 57\n\n⇒ __16** - 0.5**__ = 57\n\n⇒ 15.5 ≠ 57 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 3) + and - \n\n10 - 2 ÷ 4 + 6 × 3 = 19 ⇒ 10 + 2 ÷ 4 - 6 × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 10 + __**2 ÷ 4**__ - 6 × 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 10 + 0.5 - __**6 × 3**__ = 19\n\n⇒ __**10 + 0.5**__ - 18 = 19\n\n⇒ __**10.5 - **18__ = 19\n\n⇒ -7.5 ≠ 19 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4) × and ÷\n\n10 - 2 ÷ 4 + 6 × 3 = 19 ⇒ 10 - 2 × 4 + 6 ÷ 3 = 19\n\n⇒ 10 - 2 × 4 + __**6 **____**÷**____** 3**__ = 19\n\n⇒ 10 - __**2 **____**×**____** 4**__ + 2 = 19\n\n⇒ __**10 + 2**__ - 8 = 19\n\n⇒ __12** - 8**__ = 19\n\n⇒ 4 ≠ 19 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 1\" is the correct answer.",
